# check_disk_instability with R3's flags (FIREmodeOn 1, R3.par:55; SFprescription 1, BulgeSizeOn 3, every other flag and parameter R2.par's) (the FIREmodeOn 0 twin): a gas-unstable satellite's instability burst, fixed-epsilon
# The satellite (galaxy 1) is the R2 template's gas-unstable central made a Type 1 with
# stored SnapNum 31; its FoF central (galaxy 0) takes the R3 Snap_32 central's values
# (R3 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R3/model_0.hdf5, row 4) with SnapNum 32, so the two differ in
# Vvir and stored snapshot: the burst's FIRE budget must read the satellite's.
# Reachability: constructed routine-domain probe.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine check_disk_instability_fire

i32 params.SFprescription 1  # R3 (R3.par:48): BR06 with radial integration
